// GrantPermission ceilings synthesised by ProxyPolicyGenerator from
//   jinitest.policy
//
// Each block below is the MINIMAL GrantPermission that admits exactly the
// permissions the named proxy codebase exercised during the audited run.
// It is the meta-capability bounding what may be dynamically granted for
// that proxy.  The block is scoped, by default, to the proxy codebase
// itself (per-codebase granularity).  Before deployment, ATTACH each
// ceiling to the grant block of the domain that actually calls
// DynamicPolicy.grant for the proxy (the service / exporter), re-scoping
